This fixture exercises phpc's deterministic placeholder
`mysqli_stmt_store_result()` and `mysqli_stmt_num_rows()` behavior after
unbound prepared-statement execution for the current seed-post WordPress
SELECT shape. System PHP requires a real initialized MySQLi connection and
buffered statement result state; phpc only buffers the known placeholder rows
and does not implement bound-result fetching, by-reference output buffers,
mysqlnd fidelity, host database state, PHP warning/error fidelity, or native
database lowering.
